// title: Global Admin Elevations To User Access Administrator at Root Level
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Entra
// tables: AuditLogs
// purpose: Global Admin Elevations To User Access Administrator at Root Level
// source: https://github.com/jkerai1/KQL-Queries/blob/829b34aea9fce1b50995ff348ee7be6b8eca34f3/Entra/Global%20Admin%20Elevations%20To%20User%20Access%20Administrator%20at%20Root%20Level.kql
